  "searchAppStoreToRate": "Search for ZEGA-ALERT in your app store to rate us.",
  "aboutBody": "ZEGA-ALERT is the Ethiopian Federal Police citizen safety app. It connects you to emergency dispatch, crime reporting, missing and wanted persons, official announcements and two-way communication with officers — in English, Amharic, Oromifa, Tigrinya and Ethio Somali.\n\nVersion {version}",
  "termsBody": "1. Use ZEGA-ALERT only for genuine emergencies, crime reports and public-safety information.\n\n2. Knowingly sending false reports is an offence and may lead to account suspension and legal action.\n\n3. Emergency features depend on network coverage and location services. Always call 991 if the app cannot connect.\n\n4. Reports you submit are shared with the responsible police station and regional administrators for investigation.\n\n5. Keep your account credentials private. You are responsible for activity on your account.",
  "privacyBody": "ZEGA-ALERT collects only the information needed to keep you safe: your name, phone number, region and the content of reports you choose to submit.\n\nLocation is used for SOS alerts, nearest-station lookup, safety zones and incident mapping. It is transmitted only while you use these features.\n\nContact details on missing-person notices are encrypted at rest. Sensitive information is visible only to authorised police staff.\n\nYou can browse news, wanted and missing persons as a guest. You can delete your account by contacting support."
